# 2-to-4 Decoderå

## Goal

Learn how to implement a 2-to-4 decoder in Verilog and understand how decoders are used to select hardware components based on binary inputs.

## Concepts Learned

- module
- input
- output
- assign
- combinational logic
- binary decoding
- address decoding

